      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_close" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n216.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/shofarot_close/text"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/teqa_beshofar_gadol_lecherutenu">Our God and God of our fathers, blow the great Shofar for our freedom and raise a banner for the gathering of our exiles and bring near our dispersed ones from the corners of the earth and bring us to Zion Thy city in mirth and to Jerusalem Thy sanctuary in eternal joy and there we will perform before Thee our sacrificial obligations according to the commandment given to us in Thy Torah through Thy servant Moses from the mouth of Thy glory as it is said:</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
